<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>陳師傅傳統整復推拿 - BIGBANG 20週年手燈加購活動</title>
    
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@600;700;900&family=Noto+Serif+TC:wght@400;600;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #111111;
            --card-bg: #181818;
            --accent-gold: #FFC20C;
            --accent-gold-light: #FFE58F;
            --accent-gold-dark: #B38600;
            --text-main: #E5E5E5;
            --text-muted: #8C8C8C;
            --border-color: #2A2A2A;
            --border-gold: rgba(255, 194, 12, 0.35);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif;
            line-height: 1.8;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }

        /* Top banner non-sticky layout */
        header {
            padding: 35px 20px 25px;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            background-color: #111111;
        }

        .header-title {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 0.18em;
            text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 194, 12, 0.25);
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 720px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            width: 100%;
            flex-grow: 1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        /* Main Event Card Styling */
        .event-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-gold);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 45px 35px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 30px rgba(255, 194, 12, 0.1);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .visual-box {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0A0A0A 0%, #1F1F1F 100%);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 45px 20px 35px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .crown-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent-gold) 0%, var(--accent-gold-dark) 100%);
            color: #000000;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            padding: 8px 30px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            letter-spacing: 0.15em;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(255, 194, 12, 0.4);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .crown-svg {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            margin: 0 auto 15px;
            fill: var(--accent-gold);
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(255, 194, 12, 0.5));
            display: block;
        }

        .visual-text-main {
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.1em;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 194, 12, 0.2);
            padding-top: 18px;
            margin-top: 10px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .visual-text-sub {
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            margin-top: 8px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            width: 100%;
            opacity: 0.95;
        }

        .price-box {
            margin: 25px 0 35px;
            padding: 22px;
            background: rgba(255, 194, 12, 0.04);
            border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-gold);
            border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border-gold);
        }

        .price-label {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-size: 2.4rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            display: block;
            text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 194, 12, 0.2);
        }

        .price-amount {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-size: 2.4rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        }

        .price-unit {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-right: 6px;
        }

        .official-link-box {
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .official-link {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            text-decoration: underline;
            text-underline-offset: 8px;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            display: inline-block;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .official-link:hover {
            color: var(--accent-gold-light);
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 194, 12, 0.4);
        }

        /* Footer & Disclaimer Section */
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            background-color: #0C0C0C;
        }

        .disclaimer {
            max-width: 620px;
            margin: 0 auto 16px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .disclaimer p {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .header-title {
                font-size: 1.4rem;
            }
            .event-card {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }
            .crown-badge {
                font-size: 1.05rem;
                padding: 6px 22px;
            }
            .crown-svg {
                width: 65px;
                height: 65px;
            }
            .visual-text-main {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
            }
            .visual-text-sub {
                font-size: 0.9rem;
            }
            .price-label,
            .price-amount {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
            .official-link {
                font-size: 0.95rem;
            }
            .disclaimer {
                font-size: 0.95rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1 class="header-title">陳師傅傳統整復推拿</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        <main class="event-card">
            
            <div class="visual-box">
                <span class="crown-badge">限量三名</span>
                
                <svg class="crown-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path d="M5 16L3 5l5.5 5L12 4l3.5 6L21 5l-2 11H5zm14 3c0 .6-.4 1-1 1H6c-.6 0-1-.4-1-1v-1h14v1z"/>
                </svg>

                <div class="visual-text-main">BIGBANG 20週年官方應援手燈</div>
                <div class="visual-text-sub">
                    BIGBANG OFFICIAL LIGHT STICK 20TH ANNIVERSARY EDITION – THE LIGHT RETURNS
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="price-box">
                <span class="price-label">預約推拿加購價</span>
                <div class="price-amount">
                    <span class="price-unit">NT$</span>1,950
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="official-link-box">
                <a href="https://cshmaster.github.io/fullweb/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="official-link">
                    預約請點我查看工作室官方網站
                </a>
            </div>

        </main>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <div class="disclaimer">
            <p>本活動手燈於新光三越官方商店購買，僅作為顧客活動加購使用</p>
            <p>商品皆為全新但購買現場皆有拆封檢測</p>
            <p>本工作室與官方經紀公司及相關權利單位無宣稱授權或直接合作關係</p>
        </div>

    </footer>

</body>
</html>
